  "job_B9.6.5_20251003_115055": {
    "chunk_text": "e. \u00dea gewunade oswia se cyning, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine trymede & l\u00e6rde, \u00fe\u00e6tte he ongete \u00fe\u00e6tte ne meahten Ac God ma w\u00e6re to ongeotanne in \u00ferymme unbes\u00e6ndlicne, menniscum eagum ungesenelicne, \u00d0as word & eac monig \u00feysses gemetes mid \u00fey Osweo se cyning Sigeberhte \u00feam cyninge mid Ond \u00fea h\u00e6fde ge\u00feeaht mid his weotum & freondum, & mid heora trymnesse & fultume & Is se bi \u00feam walle, \u00fee geara Romani Breotone ealond bigyrdon, twelf milum from easts\u00e6. Ono \u00fea Sigeberht se cyning \u00fea w\u00e6s ceasterwara gefremed \u00fe\u00e6s ecan rice, & wolde eft \u00fe\u00e6t se\u00f0l Ond he \u00f0a se cyning sende \u00e6rendwrecan to Middelenglum, & him to geheht Cedd \u00feone halgan \u00de\u00e6s \u00fee heo \u00fea eal \u00fea lond \u00feurhferdon & micle cirican & gesomnunge Drihtne gestryndon & \u00dea he \u00fea se biscop onget, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6re godspellican lare georne gefealh & \u00fea \u00f0eode to Cristes \u00d0a he \u00f0a h\u00e6fde biscophade onfongen, \u00fea hwearf he eft to Eastseax na m\u00e6g\u00f0e & mid maran Seo \u00e6rre stow is in Pente st\u00e6\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6re ea, o\u00f0er is in Temese st\u00e6\u00f0e. In \u00fe\u00e6m he gesomnode micel weorod Cristes \u00feeowa, & heo l\u00e6rde to healdanne regollices liifes Mid \u00fey \u00fea micelre tide in \u00fe\u00e6re foresprecenan m\u00e6g\u00f0e, gefeondum \u00feam cyninge & W\u00e6ron twegen gebro\u00f0or, \u00fee \u00feis man",
